{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-region USGS 3DEP 1/3-arc-second (~10 m) DEM manifest \u2014 the reproducible way to",
    "obtain the elevation raster in ANY environment (fixing 'elevation kept disappearing':",
    "the DEM used to live only in a transient local worktree). `scripts/fetch_dem.py`",
    "reads this, downloads each tile from `tile_base_url`, verifies its sha256 (or records",
    "it on first fetch), then merges + clips to the region bbox into `output` (under",
    "gitignored data/ \u2014 the raster itself is never committed).",
    "Tile names are USGS NW-corner cells (n{lat}w{lon} spans lat [lat-1,lat], lon",
    "[-lon,-lon+1]); regenerate a region's list from its geojson bbox with",
    "`python scripts/fetch_dem.py --init <region>`. Checksums are null until an operator",
    "runs the fetch and commits the values back (we do not fabricate them)."
  ],
  "tile_base_url": "https://prd-tnm.s3.amazonaws.com/StagedProducts/Elevation/13/TIFF/current",
